{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"bone_colossus","model_identifier":"bone_colossus","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# bone_colossus\n\nBone colossus (C1), breaker, 3.4 m = 121 u (skull 116 u, shoulder lump to 121 u).\n\nA hulking giant of fused bones: a ribcage of stacked ribs with a pale blue glow core showing between them, skulls forming its shoulders, elbows and knees, a skull head sunk between the shoulders with blue eye lights, and fists that are clubs of fused leg bones. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names plus `jaw` and a `bone_lump` bone (the lump on its left shoulder it tears off to throw).\n\n- Cubes: 38 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x256, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -35.5..35.5, y 0.0..121.0, z -14.5..11.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- two boxes: legs 30 x 58 x 20 from y = 0, upper body 64 x 63 x 28 from y = 58 (both centred on x = 0, z = -2)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.9 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 1.2 | loop |  |\n| `attack_smash` | 2 | once | key 1.05 s: both fists smash down in front (hits an arc in front; also its wall attack) |\n| `throw_boulder` | 2.4 | once | key 1.3 s: the bone lump leaves the right hand (spawn the projectile at slot_hand_r); the lump is torn off the left shoulder at 0.4-0.6 s, vanishes at the release (scale 0) and regrows on the shoulder by 2.4 s |\n| `aggro` | 2.2 | once | rears up, arms wide, beats its ribcage |\n| `injured` | 0.7 | once | heavy flinch |\n| `death` | 2.2 | hold | topples forward on its face; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.8 | loop | writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 1.9 s, 67.6 u per cycle (heavy)\n- `run`: 85.3 u/s (2.40 m/s), cycle 1.2 s, 102.4 u per cycle (lumbering charge)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_smash`: key 1.05 s: both fists smash down in front (hits an arc in front; also its wall attack)\n- `throw_boulder`: key 1.3 s: the bone lump leaves the right hand (spawn the projectile at slot_hand_r); the lump is torn off the left shoulder at 0.4-0.6 s, vanishes at the release (scale 0) and regrows on the shoulder by 2.4 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 116, -8)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 86, 12.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (8.5, 95, 12.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (14.5, 105.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 81.5, -12.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (26, 45, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-32.5, 66, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-26, 45, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (13, 61, 6.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-13, 61, 6.5)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_core is the lit ribcage glow; glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the eyes.\n- Uses `scale` keys on bone_lump in throw_boulder.\n"},"description":"# bone_colossus\n\nBone colossus (C1), breaker, 3.4 m = 121 u (skull 116 u, shoulder lump to 121 u).\n\nA hulking giant of fused bones: a ribcage of stacked ribs with a pale blue glow core showing between them, skulls forming its shoulders, elbows and knees, a skull head sunk between the shoulders with blue eye lights, and fists that are clubs of fused leg bones. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names plus `jaw` and a `bone_lump` bone (the lump on its left shoulder it tears off to throw).\n\n- Cubes: 38 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x256, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -35.5..35.5, y 0.0..121.0, z -14.5..11.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- two boxes: legs 30 x 58 x 20 from y = 0, upper body 64 x 63 x 28 from y = 58 (both centred on x = 0, z = -2)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.9 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 1.2 | loop |  |\n| `attack_smash` | 2 | once | key 1.05 s: both fists smash down in front (hits an arc in front; also its wall attack) |\n| `throw_boulder` | 2.4 | once | key 1.3 s: the bone lump leaves the right hand (spawn the projectile at slot_hand_r); the lump is torn off the left shoulder at 0.4-0.6 s, vanishes at the release (scale 0) and regrows on the shoulder by 2.4 s |\n| `aggro` | 2.2 | once | rears up, arms wide, beats its ribcage |\n| `injured` | 0.7 | once | heavy flinch |\n| `death` | 2.2 | hold | topples forward on its face; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.8 | loop | writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 1.9 s, 67.6 u per cycle (heavy)\n- `run`: 85.3 u/s (2.40 m/s), cycle 1.2 s, 102.4 u per cycle (lumbering charge)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_smash`: key 1.05 s: both fists smash down in front (hits an arc in front; also its wall attack)\n- `throw_boulder`: key 1.3 s: the bone lump leaves the right hand (spawn the projectile at slot_hand_r); the lump is torn off the left shoulder at 0.4-0.6 s, vanishes at the release (scale 0) and regrows on the shoulder by 2.4 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 116, -8)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 86, 12.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (8.5, 95, 12.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (14.5, 105.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 81.5, -12.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (26, 45, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-32.5, 66, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-26, 45, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (13, 61, 6.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-13, 61, 6.5)\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_core is the lit ribcage glow; glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the eyes.\n- Uses `scale` keys on bone_lump in throw_boulder.\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"